WEBVTT

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:05.060
<b>A curse of a blade.</b>

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:09.280
<b>A water gate of
 a yellow spring.</b>

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:13.860
<b>Who is that woman?</b>

00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:16.490
Please, wake up!

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:20.090
Are you okay?

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:22.950
Ryou'un, hang in there!

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:28.880
This wound is... from when
she protected Shuusou?

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:34.490
Please be okay, Shuusou.

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:37.010
You!

00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:39.320
You laid hands on Un-chan, didn't you?

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:41.600
I will kill you!

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:44.190
N-No!

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:47.900
She's lost so much spiritual energy.

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:51.720
Maybe Shuusou didn't survive.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:54.490
Then even if she awakens...

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:59.580
All her memories with Shuusou will be gone.

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:00.840
No...

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:03.130
That is the destiny of a lord.

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:05.290
Regrets won't help.

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:05.980
But...

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:08.700
She and Shuusou trusted each other so much.

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:10.130
That's not fair!

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:13.390
The stronger the bond between 
a lord and their general,

00:01:13.390 --> 00:01:15.800
the deeper the wound when 
that general is lost.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:20.760
That's probably why Ryou'un is still asleep.

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:23.380
The bond between a lord and their general...

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:25.880
Sonshin, was it?

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:26.600
Yes.

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:30.900
Now it's time for you and 
Shuuyu's bond to be tested.

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:34.030
You found out how to cure her?

00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:38.640
There was a record in an ancient 
text in the storehouse.

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:40.070
Then let's get started.

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:42.030
It's pretty tough.

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:44.030
Are you ready?

00:01:44.030 --> 00:01:45.220
Of course.

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:20.260
How long will you keep hiding?

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:24.120
His highness is upset, Sousei.

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:26.220
I couldn't help it, Hakuanshi-sama!

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:28.270
It's not my fault!

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:31.100
Not only did you let Mumei die,

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:34.570
you killed the general who would 
lead us to the Southern Palace.

00:03:34.570 --> 00:03:36.980
Even I can't defend you.

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:39.990
Now then, what to do?

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:43.070
The Southern Palace must be near there!

00:03:43.510 --> 00:03:44.960
Believe me!

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:48.170
I'll find it and take you there!

00:03:48.730 --> 00:03:51.670
Well, I guess we can take a look.

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:59.510
Shuuyu took a hit to her soul itself,

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:04.970
and it seems she cannot receive 
spiritual energy from you, her lord.

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:07.450
That's why she's the only 
one who was weakened.

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:12.230
We need to restore the bond between 
you and her as soon as possible,

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:17.020
or her soul will be trapped 
forever within the card.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.700
Then please start now!

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:20.380
Right.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.840
Your soul will be severed from its body,

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:25.740
and sent inside the card.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:28.540
You could call it the 
inner world of the heart.

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:34.310
There you will find Shuuyu's soul.

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:36.630
How should I save her?

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:39.930
We don't know what will happen.

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:42.880
You'll have to jump in and find out.

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:49.080
There the strength of the bond between 
you and Shuuyu will be tested.

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.510
Our bond will be tested...

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:53.390
If you fail,

00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:56.830
your soul will be trapped in the card, too,

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:59.860
and wander an empty world for eternity.

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:02.890
Be careful.

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:04.450
Right!

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:05.670
Thank you!

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:10.200
Then enter the circle and touch Shuuyu.

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:14.460
What's important is a strong 
will and your bonds.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:16.810
Never give up!

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:18.580
Shuuyu...

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:33.430
This is the world inside Shuuyu's mind?

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:41.120
I'm sorry!

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:45.460
I didn't think you'd be naked over there.

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:48.060
So, um... I...

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:49.560
Do you need something?

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:51.640
Do I need something?

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:53.300
I've come to get you out of this world.

00:05:55.170 --> 00:05:56.630
Shuuyu?

00:05:56.630 --> 00:05:58.010
Is that you?

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:00.600
Have we met?

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:04.340
What are you doing here?

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:06.540
I'm waiting for a boat.

00:06:06.950 --> 00:06:09.400
A boat? Where are you going?

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:10.460
I don't know.

00:06:10.460 --> 00:06:11.720
But very far away.

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:13.930
No, don't go.

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:15.810
Why?

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:19.760
If you do, you won't be 
able to leave this place.

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:21.310
Leave this place?

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:22.380
Why?

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:24.400
You really don't remember?

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:26.530
How we fought together?

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:28.090
Fought?

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:32.150
You came here to make me fight?

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:35.230
Why do you fight?

00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:36.840
You just get hurt.

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:37.560
I'm sorry.

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:39.000
You're right.

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.780
I put you in danger.

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:44.760
I couldn't protect you.

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:46.680
And...

00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:49.220
Let's forget it.

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:55.910
This river washes away all 
the bad things and pain.

00:06:56.820 --> 00:06:59.740
Even the empty eternity...

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:02.320
So if you stay here,

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:05.370
you won't have to suffer anymore.

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:07.980
If I stay here I can forget.

00:07:07.980 --> 00:07:09.140
That's right.

00:07:09.140 --> 00:07:11.370
So let's stay here forever.

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:16.120
Stay with me... forever.

00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:21.670
It's strange, though.

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:25.120
I hated the twilight,

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:29.020
but when I'm with you, it feels beautiful.

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:33.340
Beautiful twilight...

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:36.170
When you're with me?

00:07:37.380 --> 00:07:39.770
You're a good-for-nothing, but a bold one.

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:43.690
No, Shuuyu!

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:47.320
You can't stay here!

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:49.580
Until a little while ago,

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:53.200
I thought it was stupid to 
fight to protect history, too.

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:57.200
But I was able to meet you
because of that history!

00:07:57.560 --> 00:08:00.150
I want to protect that!

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:03.560
What? What happened?

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:14.790
Shuuyu!

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:16.920
Stop it!

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:17.850
Stay away!

00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:19.540
Run!

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:21.230
Shuuyu!

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:33.780
Stop it!

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:37.120
That spiritual aura...

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:41.540
Did he do it?

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:43.980
Stop!

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:46.830
Shuuyu!

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:49.210
Die!

00:08:55.830 --> 00:08:58.220
Sh-Shuuyu!

00:08:58.490 --> 00:09:03.730
I'm sorry for making you go through this.

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:07.900
I'm not strong enough to be your lord.

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:10.920
My lord?

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:13.240
But...

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:22.810
Sheesh...

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:28.170
You're a good-for-nothing, 
and you're still showing off.

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:29.900
Good-for-nothing?

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:30.780
It can't be...

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:41.600
Be silent!

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.680
For Shuuyu is here!

00:09:44.900 --> 00:09:45.810
Shuuyu!

00:09:54.470 --> 00:09:56.400
Retsuouken!

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:56.400
<b>Retsuouken</b>

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:05.850
What?

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:10.260
Look, Hakuanshi-sama!

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:12.710
I told you it was this lake!

00:10:13.060 --> 00:10:15.580
Look at the spiritual aura.

00:10:18.640 --> 00:10:21.260
Incredible spiritual power,

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:24.220
emitted in a single instant, it seems.

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:26.170
This is it.

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:29.730
The Southern Palace is within this lake.

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:34.610
He did it!

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:38.610
It seems he does indeed have 
bottomless spiritual power.

00:10:41.110 --> 00:10:42.910
Are you okay, Sonshin?

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:45.830
Hey, wake up!

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:49.050
Um...

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:51.530
Sheesh...

00:10:51.530 --> 00:10:54.900
He used an immense amount of spiritual power.

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:56.060
Who are you?

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:59.300
I am the Guardian of the Southern Palace.

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:00.520
Don't worry.

00:11:00.520 --> 00:11:02.210
I'm not your enemy.

00:11:02.210 --> 00:11:03.800
It seems I owe you a debt.

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:05.070
No.

00:11:05.070 --> 00:11:07.230
I've done nothing.

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:08.810
It was Sonshin,

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:11.700
the boy sleeping there, who saved you.

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:15.420
It seems you met a good lord, huh?

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:16.870
Yes.

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:25.410
What did I...

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:29.910
<b>Flames</b>

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:03.370
A girl bearing a destiny

00:13:03.370 --> 00:13:05.100
who protects the water temple.

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:08.380
Her fears become real

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:10.410
and burn down the door.

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:13.690
When a herald of destruction descends,

00:13:13.690 --> 00:13:16.040
the bonds binding the warrior are broken.

00:13:16.470 --> 00:13:18.420
Next time: "Vow."
